{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36244","headline":"出山寄苏从事 · 方干","name":"出山寄苏从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寸心似火频求荐，两鬓如霜始息机。\n隔岸鸡鸣春耨去，邻家犬吠夜渔归。\n倚松长啸宜疎拙，拂石欹眠绝是非。\n多谢元瑜怜野贱，时回车马发光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}